Also paste the same thing into the edit summary.

Check in Preview mode. Make sure everything is against a pale blue background (nothing outside) and there are no stray characters, like }}, at the top or bottom.

Save.

For more information, please see  [LINK: (T:TDYK#How to promote an accepted hook) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/T:TDYK#How_to_promote_an_accepted_hook] .

Handy copy sources:

