Overall:  Article looks good. Nice work. Regarding the hooks, the first probably is too bland per Buidhe. I think the second is kinda interesting (the "unfriendly countries list"? Hadn't heard of that before.) I don't see the quote from ALT2, "Micronesian values", in either the article or the source? I think the second, if worded right, could be made interesting enough. Perhaps something like "... that  [LINK: (Russia considers the Federated States of Micronesia) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Federated_States_of_Micronesia%E2%80%93Russia_relations]  an "unfriendly country"? What do you think? @ [LINK: (CoryGlee) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/User:CoryGlee] :  [LINK: (BeanieFan11) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/User:BeanieFan11]  ( [LINK: (talk) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/User_talk:BeanieFan11] )  [LINK: (22:54, 25 December 2025 (UTC)) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Template_talk:Did_you_know#c-BeanieFan11-20251225225400-Federated_States_of_Micronesia–Russia_relations] [ [LINK: (reply) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Template_talk:Did_you_know] ]

Hi  [LINK: (BeanieFan11) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/User:BeanieFan11] , thanks for the review. Yes, I have no problem in rewording. In fact, I have an ASD problem when it comes to summing up, LOL. As for ALT2, the Island Times source says “It is often described that the preference of any Pacific Island Country, to include the FSM, is that we be friends to all, and enemies to none,” Panuelo said.

Please for any reviewer, finish this madness. Read please all above and guess you won't need much. This is feeding, nothing else, and I am not going to get into this madness.  [LINK: (CoryGlee) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/User:CoryGlee]   [LINK: (11:20, 29 January 2026 (UTC)) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Template_talk:Did_you_know#c-CoryGlee-20260129112000-Federated_States_of_Micronesia–Russia_relations] [ [LINK: (reply) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Template_talk:Did_you_know] ]

