I can't get past the strict Bloomberg paywall but this hook is inaccurate as written. Kupor's selection as OPM director was announced in December 2024, but he was not confirmed (and thus did not assume the role) until July 2025. As written, the hook indicates Kupor had not heard of OPM even after he had been offered the role, accepted it, and underwent confirmation hearings for it. The hook needs to be recast (and the line in the article adjusted as well) before it can be promoted. Not going to offer a suggestion since the Bloomberg source is inaccessible to me.  [LINK: (Dclemens1971) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/User:Dclemens1971]  ( [LINK: (talk) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/User_talk:Dclemens1971] )  [LINK: (02:45, 15 January 2026 (UTC)) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Template_talk:Did_you_know#c-Dclemens1971-20260115024500-Staraction-20251229080400] [ [LINK: (reply) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Template_talk:Did_you_know] ]

