Comment: @ [LINK: (Pdubs.94) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/User:Pdubs.94] :  Hi, and welcome to DYK. Not a full review, but your article is good. Just a few suggestions; you can consider copying some info from the  [LINK: (WP:LEAD) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wikipedia:LEAD]  into the article body, and move the references. It would be better if the lead reflects the cited material in the body, instead of using citations in the lead. You can also complete some of the citation furnishing, like putting dates and author's first and last name in the references. Do not worry, the article has got no major problems. Thank you and all the best!  [LINK: (M.) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/User_talk:M.Billoo2000#top]   [LINK: (Billoo) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/User:M.Billoo2000]   [LINK: (03:10, 5 January 2026 (UTC)) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Template_talk:Did_you_know#c-M.Billoo2000-20260105031000-Pdubs.94-20251231182400] [ [LINK: (reply) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Template_talk:Did_you_know] ]
