Overall:  This article fulfills almost all of the requirements, and hook is interesting. The seven-day limit is not the issue, as you submitted the DYK hook one day after the deadline. However, there is an issue with the citation, as you did not include a page number for the book source (The Holocaust and Soviet War Crimes Trials in the Cold War Context: The 1964 Klaipėda War Crimes Trial). Hence, please provide the book's page number so that it can be verified. Also, it is better that the sentence of After the Soviets occupied Lithuania, they held rigged elections to the People's Seimas (parliament) to be removed since the source did not mention the election. Once you address these issues, the hook is ready to be published.  [LINK: (Faldi00) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/User:Faldi00]  ( [LINK: (talk) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/User_talk:Faldi00] )  [LINK: (18:50, 23 January 2026 (UTC)) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Template_talk:Did_you_know#c-Faldi00-20260123185000-Boleslovas_Baranauskas] [ [LINK: (reply) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Template_talk:Did_you_know] ]

