Overall:  @ [LINK: (Piotrus) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/User:Piotrus] : I think it's a good idea to do both in one go. The article was created on January 20, 2026. It has a readable prose size of 3883 characters. Every paragraph in the body of the article has sources. The article does not use promotional or overly negative language.  [LINK: (WP:EARWIG) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wikipedia:EARWIG]  shows no copyvios. QPQ was done. The hook is supported by the source. However, I don't find the part about the coupon particularly interesting. The fact that it was the first should be interesting, so we could just use

