Overall:  Excellent work as usual,  [LINK: (Vacant0) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/User:Vacant0] ! You continue to impress me with really good articles about games I feel things for. A couple of things: the source for ALT0 states "One thing I found difficult was the writing.", which does not support the superlative "found writing to be hardest" used in the hook. Also, while it's a rare treat to have freely licensed screenshots of video games to use at DYK, I just don't think this one, nor any of the others in its category, reads clearly at Main Page scale. No concerns elsewhere, and I'll probably approve with a preference for ALT2 (although I'm probably biased, considering I didn't find this nomination at  [LINK: (your RfA) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wikipedia:Requests_for_adminship/Vacant0] , but on  [LINK: (this list) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Special:PermanentLink/1334999706] ). That being said, I was surprised you hadn't gone for the obvious low-hanging fruit:

