But the source seems to indicate her talent management without being too specific (her management). Are you sure it's referring to the record company?  [LINK: (Dclemens1971) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/User:Dclemens1971]  ( [LINK: (talk) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/User_talk:Dclemens1971] )  [LINK: (03:06, 30 January 2026 (UTC)) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Template_talk:Did_you_know#c-Dclemens1971-20260130030600-Dclemens1971-20260129183300] [ [LINK: (reply) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Template_talk:Did_you_know] ]
